{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1708340,
  "courseSlug": "learn-flutter-dart-to-build-ios-android-apps",
  "courseTitle": "Flutter & Dart - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37145108",
      "title": "Getting Started with Implicit Animations",
      "lectureOrder": 204,
      "videoOrder": 188,
      "sourceHash": "3b354c103c4b505dde283f60b8cfdf778b8131a5e0b10a8a0079efc23a878317",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.71,
          "en": "So now that we covered explicit animations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.71,
          "end": 7.38,
          "en": "let's dive into implicit animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.38,
          "end": 9.06,
          "en": "And implicit animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.06,
          "end": 14.06,
          "en": "are all about using prebuilt widgets offered by flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.46,
          "end": 16.65,
          "en": "that can be used to add animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.65,
          "end": 18.96,
          "en": "to certain areas of your app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.96,
          "end": 21.18,
          "en": "And for that, attached you'll also find a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.18,
          "end": 23.7,
          "en": "to the flutter documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.7,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "to a page that lists some of the animated widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 30.93,
          "en": "offered by flutter that can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.93,
          "end": 33.27,
          "en": "to add such implicit animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.27,
          "end": 34.44,
          "en": "You'll see an example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.44,
          "end": 38.1,
          "en": "for one such animated widgets over the next minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.1,
          "end": 40.47,
          "en": "But you can also take a look at this list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.47,
          "end": 44.28,
          "en": "to find more widgets that could be helpful to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.28,
          "end": 45.42,
          "en": "Now in this app here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.42,
          "end": 47.61,
          "en": "I wanna add an implicit animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.61,
          "end": 49.35,
          "en": "in the MealDetails dart file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.35,
          "end": 51.183,
          "en": "so on the MealDetailsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.38,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "There we have this icon button in the app bar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 60.45,
          "en": "which we use to mark a meal as a favorite or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 63.45,
          "en": "So in the end, this button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.45,
          "end": 66.51,
          "en": "And now I wanna add a little animation to this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.51,
          "end": 69.18,
          "en": "so that whenever we click this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.18,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "and we change this icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 74.19,
          "en": "we also animate the icon to, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.19,
          "end": 78.36,
          "en": "give it a spin and rotate it as it changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.36,
          "end": 81.42,
          "en": "And whilst we could add this functionality",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.42,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "with an explicit animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 86.07,
          "en": "with our own animation controller,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 89.37,
          "en": "it's even easier to add this kind of animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.37,
          "end": 91.26,
          "en": "by using an implicit animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.26,
          "end": 94.59,
          "en": "So by using a prebuilt widget offered by flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.59,
          "end": 97.28999999999999,
          "en": "And indeed for many animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.28999999999999,
          "end": 100.22999999999999,
          "en": "you might want to perform pre-built widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.22999999999999,
          "end": 102.75,
          "en": "are often the better choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.75,
          "end": 105.18,
          "en": "So here for this MealDetailsScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.18,
          "end": 107.03999999999999,
          "en": "for animating this icon here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.03999999999999,
          "end": 110.34,
          "en": "whenever the favorite status changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.34,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "we can go to this icon parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 115.83,
          "en": "So we really only want to go to the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.83,
          "end": 117.27000000000001,
          "en": "that should be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.27000000000001,
          "end": 119.46000000000001,
          "en": "I don't want to animate the entire button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.46000000000001,
          "end": 122.64,
          "en": "if it's really just the icon that I want to animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.64,
          "end": 126.06,
          "en": "because the event listener here can't really be animated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.06,
          "end": 127.26,
          "en": "It's not visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.26,
          "end": 129.6,
          "en": "So I'm going to this icon here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.6,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "And here, as a value for icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 134.94,
          "en": "instead of setting this icon here as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 139.89,
          "en": "we can set animated switcher as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 142.56,
          "en": "And that is a widget provided by Flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 145.17000000000002,
          "en": "which allows us to animate the transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 145.17000000000002,
          "end": 147.45,
          "en": "from one widget to another.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.45,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "So from this star icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 152.253,
          "en": "to this star border icon, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.09,
          "end": 156.09,
          "en": "By the way, I can't use animated switcher here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 156.09,
          "end": 157.89,
          "en": "inside of icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.89,
          "end": 161.16,
          "en": "because animated switcher, in the end, is a widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.16,
          "end": 163.82999999999998,
          "en": "And inside of this icon widget here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 163.82999999999998,
          "end": 167.4,
          "en": "Flutter wants an icon data value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 169.41,
          "en": "Icon, on the other hand, wants a widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 172.53,
          "en": "so therefore, here I can use animated switcher.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.53,
          "end": 175.35,
          "en": "But how does animated switcher work now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.35,
          "end": 177.99,
          "en": "Well, it has a couple of parameters that we can set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.99,
          "end": 181.89,
          "en": "For example, the duration of the animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 181.89,
          "end": 183.693,
          "en": "but also the child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 185.31,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "And the child, in the end, should be our icon here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "So we can paste this in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 194.37,
          "en": "because that's the child which we want to animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 194.37,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "Now we also have to add a duration here, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 201.45,
          "en": "And for the duration, you can create such a duration object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 204.03,
          "en": "and it's up to you which duration you wanna set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 204.03,
          "end": 207.63,
          "en": "Here, I'll set a duration of 300 milliseconds again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 211.23,
          "en": "but you can, of course, play around with that value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.23,
          "end": 212.94,
          "en": "Now, with that, that's a good start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 212.94,
          "end": 216.63,
          "en": "but you will see that if you save this and restart the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.63,
          "end": 220.29,
          "en": "and you then go to such a meal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.29,
          "end": 222,
          "en": "nothing will change here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 222,
          "end": 224.163,
          "en": "There is no animation of this icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 225.09,
          "end": 227.28,
          "en": "Because even though we set a duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.28,
          "end": 229.35,
          "en": "and the widget that should be animated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 229.35,
          "end": 232.71,
          "en": "we haven't given animated switcher any information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 232.71,
          "end": 235.5,
          "en": "regarding which animation it should play.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 235.5,
          "end": 238.473,
          "en": "What should it do with that child?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 239.61,
          "end": 242.25,
          "en": "Well, that's the part which we'll add now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 242.25,
          "end": 246.903,
          "en": "Animated switcher also takes a so-called transition builder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.74,
          "end": 250.89,
          "en": "And transition builder wants a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 250.89,
          "end": 254.76,
          "en": "that receives a widget and an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 254.76,
          "end": 258.27,
          "en": "So therefore here we can add such a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 258.27,
          "end": 262.89,
          "en": "And as mentioned here, we get a widget and an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 262.89,
          "end": 264.69,
          "en": "So I'll name the widget child",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.69,
          "end": 267.03,
          "en": "and the animation, animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.03,
          "end": 270.33,
          "en": "Though since this here is your function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 270.33,
          "end": 273.12,
          "en": "these parameter names are also up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 273.12,
          "end": 277.83,
          "en": "And these parameter values here will be provided by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 277.83,
          "end": 279.21,
          "en": "That's really important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 279.21,
          "end": 282.36,
          "en": "You don't need to create an animation manually here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 282.36,
          "end": 285.45,
          "en": "Instead, the animated switcher will do this for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285.45,
          "end": 286.62,
          "en": "behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 286.62,
          "end": 290.31,
          "en": "It will create the animation and start the animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 290.31,
          "end": 294.27,
          "en": "and it will start the animation whenever the child changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 294.27,
          "end": 296.52,
          "en": "So it will automatically detect this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 296.52,
          "end": 300.69,
          "en": "and play the animation as the child updates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 300.69,
          "end": 303.24,
          "en": "And that's why it's an implicit animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 303.24,
          "end": 306.63,
          "en": "You don't need to worry about creating, or starting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 306.63,
          "end": 309.39,
          "en": "or stopping, or configuring the animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 309.39,
          "end": 311.313,
          "en": "That will all be done for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 312.45,
          "end": 315.09,
          "en": "That being said, though, this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 315.09,
          "end": 317.28,
          "en": "which you pass to transition builder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 317.28,
          "end": 321.84,
          "en": "also must return something which must be defined by you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 321.84,
          "end": 324.03,
          "en": "It must return a widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 324.03,
          "end": 326.67,
          "en": "but it shouldn't return any kind of widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 326.67,
          "end": 328.59,
          "en": "But instead, it should return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 328.59,
          "end": 330.75,
          "en": "one of these transition widgets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 330.75,
          "end": 333.9,
          "en": "which I already mentioned earlier in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 333.9,
          "end": 336.75,
          "en": "like fade transition or size transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 336.75,
          "end": 339.75,
          "en": "because these widgets, these transition widgets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 339.75,
          "end": 342.603,
          "en": "then describe how you want to animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 343.73,
          "end": 345.15,
          "en": "So with animated switcher,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 345.15,
          "end": 346.62,
          "en": "we say that we want to animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 346.62,
          "end": 350.79,
          "en": "whenever the child widget updates or changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 350.79,
          "end": 352.56,
          "en": "And in the transition builder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 352.56,
          "end": 355.413,
          "en": "we now return how we want to animate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 356.82,
          "end": 361.82,
          "en": "And here I'll return a rotation transition widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 361.86,
          "end": 366.69,
          "en": "which will rotate this child widget whenever it changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 366.69,
          "end": 368.373,
          "en": "So it will give it a spin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 369.21,
          "end": 371.58,
          "en": "Now, for that, it wants a turns value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 371.58,
          "end": 374.28,
          "en": "And turns is not a number like three,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 374.28,
          "end": 376.71,
          "en": "but instead an animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 376.71,
          "end": 380.85,
          "en": "Now, thankfully here we get an animation automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 380.85,
          "end": 383.73,
          "en": "so we can use this animation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 383.73,
          "end": 385.77,
          "en": "With that, we're almost done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 385.77,
          "end": 389.52,
          "en": "But rotation transition also takes a child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 389.52,
          "end": 391.8,
          "en": "And that in turn wants a widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
